tp://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"md:hidden overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 py-4 border-t border-white/10\"><a href=\"/#plataforma\" class=\"text-base font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors py-1\">Plataforma</a><a href=\"/#proceso\" class=\"text-base font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors py-1\">Proceso</a><a href=\"/#precios\" class=\"text-base font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors py-1\">Precios</a><a href=\"/#contacto\" class=\"text-base font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors py-1\">Contacto</a><a class=\"text-base font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors py-1\" href=\"/blog\" data-discover=\"true\">Blog</a><a class=\"text-base font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors py-1\" href=\"/calculadora\" data-discover=\"true\">Calculadora</a><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mt-4\"><a href=\"/#precios\" class=\"btn btn-outline text-sm py-3 justify-center\">Ver planes</a><a href=\"https://wa.me/56945613260?text=Quiero%20saber%20m%C3%A1s%20de%20WebGuru\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn btn-primary text-sm py-3 justify-center\">Agenda demo <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></nav><main class=\"px-6 md:px-12 pt-36 pb-24\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl mb-14\"><span class=\"section-label mb-5 block\">Recursos</span><h1 class=\"font-sans font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6\" style=\"font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5.5vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.04;\">Aprende a <span class=\"wg-gradient-text font-serif italic font-normal\">escalar.</span></h1><p class=\"text-wg-muted text-lg leading-relaxed\">Guías sobre CRM, automatización de WhatsApp e inteligencia artificial, escritas para quien administra un negocio de servicios y no tiene tiempo que perder.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/estrategias-de-marketing-digital-para-pymes\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/estrategias-de-marketing-digital-para-pymes.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">Marketing</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">8 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">8 estrategias de marketing digital para pymes chilenas en 2026</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">No necesitas ocho estrategias. Necesitas dos bien hechas. Este artículo ordena las ocho por lo que cuestan y lo que tardan en dar resultado, para que elijas las tuyas.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/tipos-de-anuncios-publicitarios\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/tipos-de-anuncios-publicitarios.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">Publicidad</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">8 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">Tipos de anuncios publicitarios: cuál usar en cada etapa del embudo</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">El error caro no es elegir mal la plataforma: es poner un anuncio de cierre frente a alguien que todavía no sabe que tiene el problema.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/que-es-el-engagement\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/que-es-el-engagement.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">Marketing</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">7 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">¿Qué es el engagement y cómo se calcula de verdad?</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">Hay cuentas con 8% de engagement que no venden nada y cuentas con 1,2% que sostienen un negocio. La métrica sirve, pero no sola.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/que-es-la-segmentacion-de-clientes\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/que-es-la-segmentacion-de-clientes.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">Estrategia</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">7 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">Segmentación de clientes: cómo dividir tu base sin complicarte</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">Segmentar no es tener quince listas. Es poder responder una pregunta: ¿a quién le escribo esta semana y qué le digo que no le diría al resto?</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/que-es-un-copywriter\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/que-es-un-copywriter.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">Copywriting</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">7 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">¿Qué hace un copywriter y cuándo conviene contratar uno?</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">Un copywriter no \"escribe bonito\". Cambia el orden en que aparece la información para que la persona llegue a la decisión antes de aburrirse.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/que-es-un-webinar\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/que-es-un-webinar.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">Marketing</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">8 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">¿Qué es un webinar y cómo organizar el primero sin fallar?</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">De cada 100 inscritos llegan entre 25 y 40. El webinar no se gana el día del webinar: se gana en los siete días siguientes.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/que-es-la-planeacion-estrategica\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/que-es-la-planeacion-estrategica.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">Estrategia</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">8 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">Planeación estratégica para pymes: del diagnóstico al plan de 90 días</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">El plan estratégico que se escribe en enero y se abre en diciembre no era un plan. Era un documento. La diferencia está en el ciclo de revisión.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/como-hacer-un-estudio-de-mercado\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/como-hacer-un-estudio-de-mercado.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">Estrategia</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">8 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">Cómo hacer un estudio de mercado sin presupuesto</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">Veinte conversaciones bien hechas te dicen más que una encuesta de doscientas respuestas mal preguntadas. Y cuestan cero.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/como-hacer-una-encuesta-en-whatsapp\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/como-hacer-una-encuesta-en-whatsapp.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">WhatsApp</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">6 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">Cómo hacer una encuesta en WhatsApp: 3 métodos que funcionan</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">WhatsApp tiene tasas de respuesta que ningún email alcanza. El problema es que la mayoría pregunta en el momento equivocado del ciclo.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/mensaje-cerrado-por-vacaciones-whatsapp-business\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/mensaje-cerrado-por-vacaciones-whatsapp-business.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">WhatsApp</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">6 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">Mensaje de cerrado por vacaciones en WhatsApp Business: 10 ejemplos</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">El mensaje automático evita que te escriban enojados. Lo que evita perder al cliente es lo que pasa con ese mensaje cuando vuelves.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-wg-blue/10\" href=\"/blog/como-crear-un-pie-de-firma-profesional\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"relative h-48 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"/blog/como-crear-un-pie-de-firma-profesional.webp\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-wg-blue uppercase tracking-wider\">Productividad</span><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-wg-muted\">6 min</span></div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-wg-blue transition-colors text-white/90\">Cómo crear un pie de firma profesional para tu correo</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-wg-muted leading-relaxed\">Treinta minutos una vez, y queda funcionando en cada correo que mandes durante años. Es la mejor relación esfuerzo/retorno que hay.</p></div></a><a class=\"group block card-surface rounded-3xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl